    "overview": "The Ant Iris Pro 2K Webcam is a professional-grade webcam designed to deliver sharp, detailed video for meetings, online classes, webinars, interviews, streaming, and content creation. Featuring 2K resolution at 2592×1944 with a 5MP image sensor and smooth 30FPS performance, it provides clear and detailed visuals for professional communication. Its intelligent Auto Focus keeps the subject sharp, while Auto Exposure automatically balances brightness across different lighting conditions. The built-in omni-directional microphone captures voice clearly without requiring additional accessories. With USB Plug & Play connectivity, a 70° wide-angle lens, and an adjustable universal mount, the Iris Pro is compatible with laptops, personal computers, monitors, and flat surfaces. Supporting Windows, macOS, ChromeOS, and compatible Android devices, it is a versatile choice for professional and home workstation setups.",
